Subject: power: avoid writing an unchanged ambient brightness target

Keep updating the time-weighted accumulator on every sensor report. Only skip
an automatic write if its rounded percentage is already the observed value.
A manual change, dimming, or resumed backlight remains observable through the
existing backlight getter; this is not a permanent cache of the last request.

--- a/plugins/power/gsd-power-manager.c
+++ b/plugins/power/gsd-power-manager.c
@@ -3008,7 +3008,8 @@
                  manager->ambient_accumulator);
         pc = manager->ambient_accumulator;
 
-        if (manager->backlight)
+        if (manager->backlight &&
+            pc != gsd_backlight_get_brightness (manager->backlight, NULL))
                 gsd_backlight_set_brightness_async (manager->backlight, pc, NULL, NULL, NULL);
 
         /* Assume setting worked. */
